(function() {
            P.when('cr-A', 'ready').execute(function(A) {
                if(typeof A.toggleExpanderAriaLabel === 'function') {
                    A.toggleExpanderAriaLabel('review_text_read_more', 'Read more of this review', 'Read less of this review');
                }
            });
        })();


        .review-text-read-more-expander:focus-visible {
            outline: 2px solid #2162a1;
            outline-offset: 2px;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }











    Monitor is beautiful and colors are almost accurate ( you can compare in one of my pic with wallpaper on laptop and monitor ) refresh rate is fine and VA panel does its job just awesome. I have got this mounted as per my requirement and this floating display added aesthetics to my desk. Resolution is fine you can work on multiple windows on same screen with appropriate font size, its comfortable . Overall a good purchase for home office / studio. Complete value for money.

